# Tools the scan engine must be able to execute, installed from the Kali repo.
# Generated 2026-08-30 from the gap between the active catalogue (183 tools)
# and what the runtime image actually had (86). One package per line.
#
# Why this exists: the catalogue advertised 183 tools while the container
# running them had 86, so 97 of them failed at execution with
# "Tool binary not found" — which is what produced the 764 'broken' and
# 471 'missing' rows in the tool health table.

